<title>USA: Suburban Ostomy Supply Q4 net shrinks.</title>
<headline>Suburban Ostomy Supply Q4 net shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLISTON, Mass. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>In millions, except per share and percentage amounts</p>
<p>			   For the three		   For the year</p>
<p>				months ended:			ended:</p>
<p>			 Aug. 31,  Sept. 2,	 Aug. 31,  Sept. 2,</p>
<p>			  1996     1995		   1996     1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	   $23.3	$13.3		 $72.6   $52.7</p>
<p> Net Income	    0.4	  0.5		   2.4     4.2</p>
