<p>Common Shares</p>
<p>    Outstanding     10.8	  9.3		  10.8     9.3</p>
<p>NOTE - (A) Supplemental pro forma net income per share for the years ended August 31, 1996 and September 2, 1995 have been calculated as if the company had been subject to federal and state income taxes for 1995 and as if, at the beginning of the respective periods, the company had sold, at an assumed offering price of $12.00 per share, shares of common stock sufficient to fund the July 3, 1995 recapitalization and repay indebtedness incurred in 1996 to fund the acquisitions of St. Louis Ostomy and Patient-Care.</p>
<p>Full company name is Suburban Ostomy Supply Co</p>
